WEBVTT

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:51.570
Huh?

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:53.200
That's...

00:01:55.233 --> 00:01:56.233
A village!

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:03.330
I'm starving, maro.

00:02:03.433 --> 00:02:07.303
What rotten luck.
Breaking down in a place like this!

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:10.130
That's why I'm fixing it right now!

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:11.900
How's it going, Kluke?

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.900
It's not a difficult malfunction, but...

00:02:17.766 --> 00:02:19.666
It's a difficult place to weld.

00:02:20.566 --> 00:02:21.626
Do you have any spare parts?

00:02:22.033 --> 00:02:23.033
No...

00:02:23.633 --> 00:02:24.873
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:02:25.933 --> 00:02:30.433
In that case,
I'll go get parts and food!

00:02:30.866 --> 00:02:35.766
THE SHADOW WIELDER'S APPRENTICE

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.270
Why are we doing
something stupid like this?

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:45.200
Stop complaining!
Procurement is important, too.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.070
Okay, please get me one of these!

00:02:48.666 --> 00:02:50.766
I wanna eat meat, maro!

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.870
I want something sweet!

00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:54.333
Use this.

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:56.070
Don't spend unnecessarily.

00:02:56.933 --> 00:02:59.003
Being an errand boy is important?

00:03:00.433 --> 00:03:02.433
There could always be
enemies lurking around.

00:03:02.933 --> 00:03:04.933
You know what happens then, right?

00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:08.173
Sure, you can get
as rowdy as you want.

00:03:13.766 --> 00:03:15.526
Wait!

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:17.470
Damn, where is he?!

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.400
He couldn't have gotten very far...

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.330
There he is! Over there!

00:03:26.366 --> 00:03:27.366
Oh shoot.

00:03:27.633 --> 00:03:29.133
Hey, wait!

00:03:44.133 --> 00:03:45.473
What the hell?!

00:03:45.766 --> 00:03:48.526
Help! I'm being chased by bandits!

00:03:48.733 --> 00:03:49.733
Bandits?

00:03:49.966 --> 00:03:50.626
Yeah.

00:03:51.033 --> 00:03:52.103
I found him!

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.333
Putting us through all this trouble...

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.200
It's them!

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:00.570
Are you his comrade?

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:02.800
No, I'm not, but...

00:04:02.933 --> 00:04:06.333
Then hand him over.
We don't have any business with you.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.270
Did he do something?

00:04:08.566 --> 00:04:10.266
From our hideout, he...

00:04:10.733 --> 00:04:12.103
From bandits' hideout?

00:04:12.433 --> 00:04:14.773
Don't say "bandits" in front of bandits!

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:16.900
Bandits have feelings, too!

00:04:19.933 --> 00:04:21.073
Back to our business...

00:04:21.633 --> 00:04:24.603
He stole jewels from our hideout.

00:04:24.966 --> 00:04:25.626
Huh?!

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:27.270
Really?

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:28.500
Yeah, kind of.

00:04:29.633 --> 00:04:31.673
Even if it was "kind of," it was wrong!

00:04:32.033 --> 00:04:33.803
Bandits shouldn't lecture people.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:35.800
I said don't call us that!

00:04:36.166 --> 00:04:40.196
Bro, never mind.
Let's just hurry up and take care of this.

00:04:40.433 --> 00:04:41.633
Yeah, you're right.

00:04:42.133 --> 00:04:43.503
Take 'em down!

00:04:43.733 --> 00:04:45.003
Help!

00:04:45.033 --> 00:04:45.703
Huh?!

00:04:45.733 --> 00:04:46.403
Huh?

00:04:46.466 --> 00:04:47.126
Huh?

00:04:47.166 --> 00:04:47.796
Huh?

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.270
I don't really know
what's going on, but...

00:04:50.366 --> 00:04:51.996
Blue Dragon!

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.600
W-What the hell is that?

00:04:58.766 --> 00:04:59.826
He's a Shadow Wielder.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.530
Run!

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:06.900
Is that a Shadow?!

00:05:07.433 --> 00:05:08.633
Uh, yeah.

00:05:17.066 --> 00:05:20.026
I see...
You're here to get some food.

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:21.730
My name is Tonto.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:23.570
My name is Shu.

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:25.930
The Shadow's name is Blue Dragon!

00:05:26.466 --> 00:05:27.766
How did you know that?!

00:05:28.066 --> 00:05:29.066
You said his name earlier.

00:05:29.333 --> 00:05:30.773
Oh, I see.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.130
By the way,
why did you steal the jewels?

00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:37.096
I'm training! I want to get stronger!

00:05:37.766 --> 00:05:40.696
So I thought I'd steal back
what the bad guys stole first

00:05:40.733 --> 00:05:42.503
and punish them, but...

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.100
It's reckless to do that alone.

00:05:45.633 --> 00:05:46.303
I've got an idea!

00:05:47.433 --> 00:05:49.973
Shu! Please be my master!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.000
W-What?!

00:05:51.566 --> 00:05:54.566
I want to get stronger and
become a Shadow Wielder!

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.970
You say it with sparkles
in your eyes, but still...

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.000
Then it's decided!

00:05:59.033 --> 00:06:02.103
My house is just around the corner!
Let's go!

00:06:02.533 --> 00:06:04.333
W-Wait a second!

00:06:06.866 --> 00:06:07.866
A blacksmith?

00:06:08.266 --> 00:06:09.266
Come on in.

00:06:09.666 --> 00:06:12.796
They might have the parts
we need for Mechat.

00:06:19.666 --> 00:06:20.666
That's my older sister.

00:06:23.966 --> 00:06:24.966
Hello.

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.070
Wow...

00:06:29.466 --> 00:06:30.466
Don't let her bother you.

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.000
Too late.

00:06:32.733 --> 00:06:33.873
Wait here a second, okay?

00:06:35.133 --> 00:06:38.303
I'll go get loads of
delicious things for you.

00:06:39.700 --> 00:06:41.000
Hey, Tonto...

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.170
Umm...

00:06:50.766 --> 00:06:52.566
Can you make a part like this?

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:06.070
W-What is it?

00:07:06.733 --> 00:07:07.733
You're distracting me.

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:16.400
Where did Tonto go, anyway?

00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:18.033
Master!

00:07:18.066 --> 00:07:18.726
Huh?!

00:07:18.933 --> 00:07:20.903
I got a bunch of stuff!

00:07:20.933 --> 00:07:22.403
T-That much?!

00:07:22.966 --> 00:07:23.626
Yeah.

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:25.070
Hey!

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:27.730
You stole my tomatoes again!

00:07:28.666 --> 00:07:31.866
I didn't steal them.
When I was singing...

00:07:32.733 --> 00:07:36.103
Hello little tomatoes,
let's play, let's play!

00:07:36.500 --> 00:07:38.130
- Toma Toma?
- Toma Toma?

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:39.930
- Tomato...
- Tomato...

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:43.330
Liar!

00:07:43.533 --> 00:07:44.803
It's the truth.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:46.430
Then, Tonto...

00:07:47.466 --> 00:07:50.366
Are you saying that my apples
followed you here, too?

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:51.870
The apples...

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:56.200
Little apples, you're so cute,
you're so cute...

00:07:56.233 --> 00:07:58.073
- Apple!
- Apple!

00:07:59.133 --> 00:08:01.203
- Apple, Apple!
- Apple, Apple!

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.130
Come on...

00:08:03.466 --> 00:08:04.726
I'm not just saying that.

00:08:07.766 --> 00:08:10.166
Gimme back my potatoes!

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:11.700
These potatoes...

00:08:13.133 --> 00:08:17.603
Potatoes, potatoes, hello, hello...

00:08:17.633 --> 00:08:19.603
Taters!

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.230
You think this is funny?

00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:24.633
- Tonto!
- Tonto!

00:08:24.766 --> 00:08:26.566
I'm innocent!

00:08:26.733 --> 00:08:28.633
It's impossible to believe
you're innocent.

00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:31.173
I'll pay for these.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.200
Well then, let's head home.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:37.670
What about my change?

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:40.800
He's stolen a lot of things
from us before.

00:08:40.833 --> 00:08:42.433
No change.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:44.170
I can't believe this...

00:08:45.033 --> 00:08:48.503
I think it's time that you
start changing your ways.

00:08:48.966 --> 00:08:49.626
About what?

00:08:49.933 --> 00:08:53.433
Are you kidding?
All you've been doing is stealing.

00:08:53.466 --> 00:08:54.666
No, you're wrong.

00:08:54.933 --> 00:08:57.573
I got those jewels back
from the bad guys.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:01.070
And with the food, all I did was help
those farmers share their extra stuff.

00:09:01.266 --> 00:09:02.466
Oh, come on...

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.400
Sis?

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:21.530
What do you think you're doing?!
And in front of my master, too!

00:09:21.833 --> 00:09:22.833
Master?

00:09:23.233 --> 00:09:26.473
He is a Shadow Wielder and
I've become his apprentice!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.700
Wait a minute!
Stop shooting off your mouth!

00:09:29.733 --> 00:09:30.733
A Shadow Wielder?

00:09:30.933 --> 00:09:31.933
Master!

00:09:31.966 --> 00:09:34.396
- I'm not your master,
- Help, Master!

00:09:34.433 --> 00:09:37.773
- and you're not my apprentice!
- Please! Please!

00:09:40.833 --> 00:09:45.073
Tonto! Cut it out already!

00:09:47.233 --> 00:09:48.433
Sis! What theâ€”?

00:09:48.466 --> 00:09:50.326
When did you grab
something like that?

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:51.800
Help!

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.800
How dare you trick my little brother!

00:09:57.133 --> 00:09:58.703
What, me?

00:09:59.333 --> 00:10:00.673
Wait!

00:10:01.433 --> 00:10:03.373
Gimme a break!

00:10:04.466 --> 00:10:06.126
Wait!

00:10:11.066 --> 00:10:12.066
Help!

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.200
Wait!

00:10:18.066 --> 00:10:19.926
There's no escape now.

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:25.900
Prepare yourself!

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.800
A-Are you okay?

00:10:36.166 --> 00:10:37.666
Are you crying?

00:10:39.433 --> 00:10:40.703
They were murdered...

00:10:41.666 --> 00:10:42.326
Huh?

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.970
Our parents were murdered!

00:10:46.433 --> 00:10:48.233
By a Shadow Wielder just like you!

00:10:49.466 --> 00:10:52.196
Tonto and I were
still young children when...

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.000
Resist, and you'll be destroyed!

00:11:03.033 --> 00:11:04.203
W-What the hell is that?

00:11:04.233 --> 00:11:05.633
His shadow turned into a monster?!

00:11:16.133 --> 00:11:17.633
There's trouble in the village.

00:11:18.166 --> 00:11:19.496
Your mother and I will go check it out!

00:11:20.066 --> 00:11:23.666
You wait here quietly with Tonto.
We'll be right back.

00:11:55.166 --> 00:11:57.166
So the Grankingdom
came to this village...

00:11:57.933 --> 00:12:00.203
That's why you hate
Shadow Wielders...

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.530
Does Tonto remember the incident?

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:06.530
He was too young to remember it.

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:08.070
I see.

00:12:08.833 --> 00:12:11.833
But why does he want to
become a Shadow Wielder?

00:12:12.333 --> 00:12:15.603
Last year, the Grankingdom troops
came to this village again.

00:12:18.766 --> 00:12:22.196
There were twin Shadow Wielders
riding a huge tank.

00:12:36.533 --> 00:12:37.673
Wow...

00:12:37.733 --> 00:12:38.773
Shadow Wielders...

00:12:39.366 --> 00:12:42.366
Those are Shadow Wielders?! Cool!

00:12:42.533 --> 00:12:43.973
What are you saying, Tonto?!

00:12:44.466 --> 00:12:46.896
With our village already
destroyed once,

00:12:46.933 --> 00:12:48.503
we didn't have
the courage to fight.

00:12:49.533 --> 00:12:51.403
We gave the Shadow Wielders

00:12:51.433 --> 00:12:53.803
all the village's food
just as they demanded.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:55.330
Awesome!

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.500
You can live life easy if you
become a Shadow Wielder!

00:12:57.533 --> 00:12:58.533
Tonto?

00:12:58.766 --> 00:13:01.666
I'm gonna be a Shadow Wielder
when I grow up

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.700
and make your life easier, Sis!

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:08.730
For something like that?

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.300
We were always poor, so...

00:13:11.833 --> 00:13:14.103
But they were bad guys, right?

00:13:14.333 --> 00:13:17.633
Tonto doesn't understand
anything about Shadow Wielders!

00:13:18.033 --> 00:13:19.773
He just thinks they're
strong and cool.

00:13:20.866 --> 00:13:23.766
Shadow Wielders are
just tools of war...

00:13:24.466 --> 00:13:25.766
I hate war!

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.200
And I hate Shadow Wielders
who take part in it!

00:13:28.733 --> 00:13:32.373
So I hate you, too!
It doesn't matter if you're good or bad!

00:13:33.333 --> 00:13:36.073
You're fighting a war too, right?

00:13:36.433 --> 00:13:38.803
I won't let Tonto become
a Shadow Wielder, no matter what!

00:13:40.333 --> 00:13:43.703
If Tonto became a Shadow Wielder,
he'd go to war, too!

00:13:47.466 --> 00:13:49.096
I hate war, too.

00:13:49.966 --> 00:13:52.826
But the Grankingdom
attacked my village, too.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.470
So we had to fight!

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.670
Then do it elsewhere!

00:13:58.333 --> 00:14:00.303
Tonto and this village have
nothing to do with it!

00:14:01.366 --> 00:14:03.326
Our village is finally peaceful again.

00:14:03.933 --> 00:14:08.433
I'm sick of people dying
or getting hurt in a war!

00:14:10.833 --> 00:14:15.503
I'm a blacksmith but I don't
make any instruments of war.

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.530
I only make farm tools and
everyday items like pots and pans.

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:24.770
I understand why you'd hate war
and Shadow Wielders.

00:14:25.566 --> 00:14:28.196
So why don't you talk to Tonto
and try to convince him?

00:14:28.633 --> 00:14:32.033
I tried to talk to him
once before, but...

00:14:33.633 --> 00:14:36.373
Listen, Tonto.
I'm going to tell you the truth.

00:14:36.733 --> 00:14:41.603
Our father and mother died during
the fight against the Shadow Wielders.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:43.200
Oh, come on.

00:14:43.233 --> 00:14:46.433
You're just saying that because you
want me to become a blacksmith.

00:14:46.766 --> 00:14:47.766
It's no use!

00:14:47.866 --> 00:14:50.296
'Cause I've already made up my mind
to become a Shadow Wielder!

00:14:50.766 --> 00:14:53.866
If you keep telling lies like that,
you'll never find a husband!

00:14:54.533 --> 00:14:56.503
Hey! Wait, Tonto!

00:14:57.233 --> 00:14:59.803
He didn't even try to believe
what I was saying...

00:15:00.566 --> 00:15:01.966
That's a problem.

00:15:02.866 --> 00:15:04.996
Hey, why don't you talk to him

00:15:05.033 --> 00:15:07.433
and tell him not to become
a Shadow Wielder?!

00:15:07.966 --> 00:15:09.566
Since you're
a Shadow Wielder yourself,

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:11.070
he might actually listen to you!

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:12.970
Hmm...

00:15:13.233 --> 00:15:14.233
Hey!

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:16.770
Something terrible's happened!

00:15:17.266 --> 00:15:19.366
Tonto was captured by bandits!

00:15:19.666 --> 00:15:20.326
- Huh?!
- Huh?!

00:15:30.266 --> 00:15:32.426
Let go! Let go of me!

00:15:33.133 --> 00:15:36.303
We got interrupted earlier,
but we've recovered our jewels back.

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:40.770
What do you mean, "recovered"?
You stole them in the first place.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:42.770
Stuff I steal becomes my stuff.

00:15:43.033 --> 00:15:45.273
And my stuff belongs to me.

00:15:45.466 --> 00:15:46.866
What are you talking about?

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:49.130
That's our way of life.

00:15:49.266 --> 00:15:51.496
So much cooler than any
Shadow Wielder, don't you think?

00:15:51.633 --> 00:15:53.003
Huh?

00:15:54.966 --> 00:15:55.626
Tonto!

00:16:01.333 --> 00:16:02.573
So you've come, Shadow Wielder.

00:16:03.166 --> 00:16:04.166
Master!

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:05.630
Let him go!

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.300
I'm gonna settle my score with you.

00:16:09.333 --> 00:16:11.073
Let's go, guys!

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:12.500
- Right!
- Right!

00:16:17.533 --> 00:16:18.903
Surprised, huh?!

00:16:19.166 --> 00:16:21.466
We stole these from
the Grankingdom Army!

00:16:21.833 --> 00:16:24.973
And we fixed them up so
they now work by remote control.

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.370
Pretty awesome, huh?

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:29.930
That's kind of awesome.

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:32.130
That's nothing!

00:16:32.266 --> 00:16:34.366
Come! Blue Dragon!

00:16:44.066 --> 00:16:46.226
Alright! Blue Dragon!

00:16:46.466 --> 00:16:47.996
Get'em! Get'em!

00:16:48.266 --> 00:16:50.766
Shut up! Shoot! Shoot!

00:16:54.433 --> 00:16:56.033
No big deal!

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.670
So cool!

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:00.700
Let's go, Blue Dragon!

00:17:03.966 --> 00:17:04.626
Tonto!

00:17:07.066 --> 00:17:08.066
Sis?!

00:17:08.366 --> 00:17:09.396
Are you okay?

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:10.600
Good grief!

00:17:10.633 --> 00:17:13.673
This is what happens when you
get into mischief all the time!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:20.970
I hate war!

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:24.630
If Tonto became a Shadow Wielder,
he'd go to war, too!

00:17:33.666 --> 00:17:35.626
Hey! What are you doing, Shu?!

00:17:37.066 --> 00:17:40.926
What's wrong?!
Take down these bandits already!

00:17:40.966 --> 00:17:44.166
Hey! Don't say "bandits"
in front of bandits!

00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:46.230
Huh? He's acting funny.

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:50.870
What's the matter, Master?

00:17:51.233 --> 00:17:53.373
Shu, you...

00:17:53.966 --> 00:17:55.526
I'm sorry, Blue Dragon...

00:17:56.833 --> 00:17:57.833
Please understand.

00:17:58.566 --> 00:18:01.696
There are times when you have to
restrain yourself from fighting!

00:18:03.466 --> 00:18:04.996
I don't understand!

00:18:08.733 --> 00:18:10.033
B-Bro!

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.300
Oh, uh, yeah...

00:18:12.566 --> 00:18:14.396
Shoot, shoot, shoot!

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:39.400
Why?

00:18:40.433 --> 00:18:42.933
Why don't you fight, Master?!

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.370
Tonto, look closely...

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:49.330
Shadow Wielders aren't
as cool as you think.

00:18:51.966 --> 00:18:53.066
Master...

00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:58.000
And Shadow Wielders aren't
as strong as you think, either.

00:19:01.666 --> 00:19:02.666
That's a lie...

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.370
You're lying, lying, lying!

00:19:05.400 --> 00:19:07.200
That's all a lie!

00:19:08.666 --> 00:19:10.166
Open your eyes, Tonto!

00:19:13.633 --> 00:19:16.503
War follows Shadow Wielders.

00:19:16.933 --> 00:19:19.873
Wars hurt and kill people.

00:19:20.433 --> 00:19:24.533
They make families and friends cry.
And the sorrow just keeps spreading...

00:19:25.466 --> 00:19:28.426
Burn what you see now
into your memory, Tonto!

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:34.630
I don't really understand what's going on,
but shoot! Shoot, shoot!

00:19:42.433 --> 00:19:43.433
Shu!

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:51.170
Tonto?!

00:19:53.633 --> 00:19:55.933
That's what happens
when you mess with us!

00:19:56.566 --> 00:19:58.326
Don't get carried away!

00:20:04.433 --> 00:20:09.703
W-Well, why don't we call it a day.
We did recover our jewels, after all...

00:20:09.733 --> 00:20:11.903
Come on guys, let's get out of here!

00:20:11.933 --> 00:20:13.573
- R-Right!
- R-Right!

00:20:16.933 --> 00:20:18.233
Shu!

00:20:19.233 --> 00:20:21.503
Shu! Hang in there, Shu!

00:20:21.766 --> 00:20:24.126
Shu! Shu!

00:20:30.833 --> 00:20:32.003
Thank you, Shu.

00:20:32.666 --> 00:20:36.266
You didn't fight
because of Tonto, right?

00:20:37.066 --> 00:20:38.426
Don't worry about it.

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:42.200
I've been in near-death situations
many times.

00:20:43.033 --> 00:20:45.273
That's what Shadow Wielders
truly are.

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:49.170
This isn't necessarily
to thank you, but...

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:50.370
Here...

00:20:50.966 --> 00:20:54.766
I made a part like the one
that was in your pocket.

00:20:55.633 --> 00:20:57.503
Thank you! I really appreciate it!

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.830
But are you sure?

00:21:00.366 --> 00:21:02.426
I know you only make
farming tools and pots.

00:21:04.133 --> 00:21:07.773
Yeah. And I learned that not all
Shadow Wielders are bad guys.

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:11.430
Oh, where's Tonto?

00:21:15.066 --> 00:21:17.726
I'm not gonna be
a Shadow Wielder anymore!

00:21:18.366 --> 00:21:19.366
Tonto?!

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:21.770
I'm gonna be a bandit!

00:21:23.466 --> 00:21:25.726
I'm gonna become a happy bandit!

00:21:26.133 --> 00:21:29.603
I'll become a bandit who
rakes in heaps of treasures

00:21:29.633 --> 00:21:32.033
so you can have
an easier life, Sis!

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:36.230
Will you knock it off?!

00:21:36.333 --> 00:21:37.933
I'm joking. I'm just joking!

00:21:37.966 --> 00:21:40.466
It's not funny! You idiot!

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:42.870
You won't find a husband
if you get angry like that!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:44.600
Shut up! You impudent little!

00:21:44.633 --> 00:21:46.403
Wait!

00:21:47.266 --> 00:21:49.396
Now then,
it's about time to go back.

00:21:50.266 --> 00:21:51.696
But before that...

00:21:57.333 --> 00:21:59.073
Crushing Nail!

00:22:01.866 --> 00:22:03.666
Blue Explosion!

00:22:07.900 --> 00:22:10.030
We took down the bandits,
so let's go.

00:22:10.366 --> 00:22:11.026
Yeah.

00:22:11.333 --> 00:22:14.833
Don't use the word "bandit"
in front of bandits!

00:22:18.133 --> 00:22:19.833
Shu's taking his time, maro...

00:22:20.100 --> 00:22:22.400
My stomach and back
feel like they've fused...

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:23.870
Hey!

00:22:23.900 --> 00:22:25.770
He's back, maro!

00:22:26.833 --> 00:22:28.203
Darling!

00:22:28.233 --> 00:22:29.773
Meat!

00:22:29.933 --> 00:22:32.373
Shu, how did you get that injury?

00:22:32.833 --> 00:22:34.003
Oh, I just tripped.

00:22:34.033 --> 00:22:35.573
What a klutz.

00:22:35.866 --> 00:22:37.766
You did bring change back,
didn't you?

00:22:37.800 --> 00:22:38.470
Gulp!

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:40.330
Hurry up and give me
some meat, maro!

00:22:40.366 --> 00:22:41.366
Meat!

00:22:41.400 --> 00:22:43.170
Let's get going after we finish eating.

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:44.500
- Okay!
- Okay!

00:24:17.166 --> 00:24:18.596
Marumaro returns
to his homeland

00:24:18.633 --> 00:24:20.233
and runs wild trying to
look at girls' underwear.

00:24:20.266 --> 00:24:22.966
A pair of underwear that I really prize
have disappeared, maro.

00:24:23.000 --> 00:24:24.130
What kind of underwear are they?

00:24:24.166 --> 00:24:25.526
They're pure white, maro.

00:24:25.566 --> 00:24:28.066
Oh, don't cry.
Here, make do with these.

00:24:28.100 --> 00:24:30.270
Who the hell took my underwear?

00:24:30.300 --> 00:24:32.400
Are you trying to kill me, maro?

00:24:32.600 --> 00:24:34.830
Next on Blue Dragon:
Panty Heaven
